  "title": "Spicy Mediterranean Chicken with Sausage-Stuffed Cherry Peppers",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s combination of chicken thighs, artichoke hearts, olives, pepperoncini, and spicy sausage-stuffed peppers makes for a colorful dinner with bold flavors.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-04-09T18:38:58-04:00",
